          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "સાવધાન (sāvdhān) is a tatsama, Sanskrit sāvadhāna, \"attentive, heedful\" (Monier-Williams). On a sign it is a warning by itself: સાવધાન!, look out!"
            }
