          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ટોળું — ṭoḷũ — \"a gathered crowd; a mob\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "અકસ્માત પછી ત્યાં લોકોનું મોટું ટોળું ભેગું થયું. akasmāt pachī tyā̃ lokonũ moṭũ ṭoḷũ bhegũ thayũ. After the accident a big crowd gathered there."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A neuter noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ટોળું (ṭoḷũ) comes from ṭōla, \"a division, a party\", a form CDIAL reconstructs; CDIAL lists Gujarati ṭoḷũ there, glossed \"a flock of sheep\" (CDIAL 5483). Today it is mostly a crowd of people that gathers at one spot, where ભીડ is any crowd."
            }
          ]
        },
